{"slug":"pay","fork":"Blockchains/pay","upstream":"solana-foundation/pay","branch":"main","commit":"e22d0af4ea3989a3941a66b2eefe679cf6e38f1a","indexed_at":"2026-10-04T16:40:23Z","category":"solana","description":"CLI for Agentic payments (x402, MPP, AP2).","readme_summary":"The missing payment layer for HTTP \u2014 x402 &amp; MPP payment challenges with user-authorized stablecoin signing. Wrap your CLI (`curl`, `claude`, `codex`, etc.) -- when an API returns 402, `pay` detects the payment protocol, prepares the stablecoin transaction, asks the local wallet to authorize and sign it, then retries with the payment proof. Supports both live payment standards on Solana: - **MPP** \u2014 Machine Payments Protocol - **x402** \u2014 x402 Payment Protocol Stablecoins deployed to Solana are supported out of the box. `pay` ships with a built-in MCP server, letting AI assistants request paid API calls through the same local wallet-approval flow. For unattended agents, `pay mcp` can enforce pay-kit's payment permissions before any transaction is built or signed. Configure them inline or with a strict YAML file:","install_commands":["brew install pay","npm install -g @solana/pay","git clone https://github.com/solana-foundation/pay.git","just install pay","just build   # release binary","just test    # all tests","just lint    # clippy (warnings = errors)"],"languages_bytes":{"Rust":6120377,"TypeScript":424694,"JavaScript":8056,"Swift":4853},"file_count":638,"total_bytes":13076322,"licenses":[{"path":"LICENSE","detected":"MIT","head":"MIT License Copyright (c) 2026 Solana Foundation Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to d"}],"license_spdx_github":"MIT","spdx_headers":{},"packages":[{"ecosystem":"cargo","name":"pay-bench","version":null,"path":"rust/bench/Cargo.toml","license":null,"dependencies":["pay-core","pay-api-core","pay-worker","pay-proxy","pay-types","pay-kit",